    "sections": {
        "description": "Bee Elegant Interior is a clean, responsive, and well-structured theme designed for interior designers, home decorators, architects, furniture stores, home renovation companies, modular kitchen designers, and interior styling professionals. It includes dedicated sections for displaying portfolios, services, project galleries, team members, testimonials, and contact information in an organized layout. The Free Interior WordPress Theme supports high-quality images, making it suitable for showcasing residential interiors, commercial spaces, office interiors, living room designs, bedroom décor, custom furniture, lighting solutions, and home décor collections. Built with responsive design principles, it adapts smoothly to different screen sizes for a consistent browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customization options through the WordPress Customizer allow users to modify colors, typography, logos, and layout settings without editing code. The theme is developed with SEO-friendly code, optimized for performance, translation-ready, and compatible with popular WordPress plugins, providing a reliable foundation for creating professional interior design and home décor websites."
    },
